WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.690 --> 00:00:20.810
Nero looked around.

2
00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:25.310
They were in a huge room filled with machines.

3
00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.730
"Where's Dr. Shady's lab?" he thought.

4
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.860
Dad walked away to talk to someone.

5
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:44.260
Nero hopped out of the backpack. "Surprise!"

6
00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:48.444
Dev jumped. "Yikes!"

7
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:53.620
Then he frowned. "You're in big trouble, Nero."

8
00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.720
"Never mind that," Nero said.

9
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.080
"We're near Dr. Shady's lab!"

10
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:07.100
"What?" Dev shook his head. "No way.

11
00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.740
Dad would know about her lab."

12
00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.100
"I'm telling you it's here," Nero said.

13
00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:18.200
"And I'm going to use my dog senses to find it!"

14
00:01:20.054 --> 00:01:25.700
"Wait." Dev stuffed Nero into a cart.

15
00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:31.670
"Hey—Ooh! Cereal!" Nero said.

16
00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:39.010
Nero bit a cereal box. "Darn! It's empty."

17
00:01:40.390 --> 00:01:43.049
"I'll push you around the factory," Dev said.

18
00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:46.450
"But we won't find Dr. Shady's lab."

19
00:01:46.728 --> 00:01:50.589
Nero sniffed the air and pointed with his nose.

20
00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:52.630
"Follow that smell!"

21
00:01:53.035 --> 00:01:57.450
Nero ducked down, and Dev pushed him over.

22
00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:01.870
But the smell was coming from a giant vat of cereal.

23
00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:06.950
"See?" Dev said. "There's no secret lab."

24
00:02:07.946 --> 00:02:13.154
"Okay, but . . ." Nero popped up.

25
00:02:13.155 --> 00:02:15.470
"I can try the cereal right?"

26
00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.670
He opened his mouth, but Dev closed it. "No!"

27
00:02:21.001 --> 00:02:27.391
"Fine." Nero huffed. "I'll use my dog hearing."

28
00:02:27.392 --> 00:02:32.072
He listened. "Follow that sound."

29
00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:37.560
Dev followed Nero's direction—to a giant blowing fan.

30
00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:43.594
Nero saw a button. "Maybe that opens the door to the lab."

31
00:02:43.595 --> 00:02:48.307
Dev pressed it, and the fan changed direction.

32
00:02:48.308 --> 00:02:52.932
Whoosh! It blew them across the floor!

33
00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.130
"This isn't working," Nero said.

34
00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:00.150
He jumped out of the cart and onto a ramp.

35
00:03:00.350 --> 00:03:05.059
"Ahh!" Nero slid down the ramp.

36
00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:10.182
"Nero!" Dev hissed. "Get over here!"

37
00:03:10.183 --> 00:03:16.410
Nero landed on a conveyor belt. "Whee!"

38
00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:18.869
The belt moved faster.

39
00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:22.930
"I have to get off this thing!" Nero thought.

40
00:03:23.091 --> 00:03:26.472
He slid down a chute. Crack!

41
00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.370
Cereal flew everywhere!

42
00:03:29.517 --> 00:03:34.224
"Nero!" Dev moaned

43
00:03:34.225 --> 00:03:38.444
"Nero!" someone else cried.

44
00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.540
It was Dad!
